### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Juan Perez",
  "documento": "123456789",
  "email": "juan@example.com"
}